/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 78 0 R
/E (Zara's IT systems link stores, design, production, and logistics in real time, which helps the company respond quickly throughout its supply chain. Computer-aided design, digital pattern making, telecom links, and automated distribution centers are some of the tools that help get products from idea to store shelves in just a few weeks. Allocation systems also make it possible to ship twice a week and quickly change stock levels in the middle of the season.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [27]
