/E (Zara's advantage comes from its IT systems that connect stores, designers, and production in real time. This lets new products go from idea to store in just a few weeks. The integrated POS data helps make quick decisions about restocking and markdowns. But this technology is only useful in Europe. As Zara expands further into other countries, the single-hub system becomes less effective, and there are no strong regional logistics platforms to help with fast global growth.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [11]
>>
