/E (It is recommended that Zara first create a clear plan for building its initial hub, sorting out all logistics and running small-scale trials before fully implementing. Once the model proves successful, the company can link more local stores to the hub and then launch customer experience activities to build awareness. After the first regional hub is running well, Zara can move on to developing the next one.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
